  "body": "## Contribution\n\nAdds an exact, scoped negative result for the eight-source F2 dirty-connector weight-four shell. Among all 40,320 two-sweep words (first sweep fixed by relabeling symmetry), the maximum prefix-difference coverage is 23 of 70 masks; 68 second sweeps attain the maximum. The package includes a witness, exact covered/uncovered masks, a prefix-pair versus direct-interval cross-check, and 23,552 exhaustive dirty-state scalar replays.\n\nThis is an obstruction only for the two-complete-sweep, 16-toggle family. It does not rule out other interleaved 16-toggle words, longer paths, or other alphabets. It claims no construction, selected-frontier change, or new kappa.\n\n## Cost screen\n\nThe optimistic fully charged target was 156 complete calls (16 source toggles plus two output readouts for each of 70 rows). The direct restored row-by-row schedule costs 700 calls. The tested family does not attain the 156 target. No frame, helper, copy, host, restoration, or precision expense is omitted from this connector-level model.\n\n## Reproduction\n\n`python3 -B research/eight-source-weight-four-seed84083/verify.py`\n\nExpected: `PASS_TWO_SWEEP_WEIGHT_FOUR_CENSUS`, `permutations=40320`, `covered=23/70`, `maximum_attainers=68`.\n\nPackage provenance check:\n`python3 scripts/research_package.py --package research/eight-source-weight-four-seed84083 --check-only`\n\nThe exact search and package metadata check passed locally under Python 3.14.7. The generic replay manifest targets Python 3.12; that interpreter is not installed in this environment.\n\n## Pins and scope\n\n- Base: `0fdd7d82de03e43c9e5a1000dfbcd380d1b687d2`\n- Track/task/seed: `recursive-interfaces` / `connector-alphabet-change` / `84083ab65f67988a33d4c6cd3f3680b7`\n- Catalogue revision 4; catalogue SHA256: `d46eb6d5b3e279428753d770653663fbdf1063e55c255ea073d768f344927ef7`\n- Selected-record SHA256: `10b9e340fd8e354a37a0c4813c90e5de1dd42044b5f6aca4a3fc5a42b685fa32`\n- Selected result, review, manifest, certificate and reproduction target are pinned in `SOURCES.json`; no selected artifacts were changed.\n- Substantial OpenAI Codex assistance is disclosed in `TASK.json`.\n\nThe public Discussion claim could not be posted because the authenticated GraphQL API was rate-limited and the REST Discussions route returned 404. The complete local claim and pre-submission overlap record are included in the package.\n",
